  "rationale": "mongodb has the highest criticality (9.5) yet no compose depends_on points at it; the env-var scan shows four services need it. It is protected, so a short degrade-only packet-loss fault is the safest way to test that hidden dependency first.",
  "hypothesis": {
    "statement": "Dropping 15% of packets leaving mongodb for 20 s will slow reads and writes through every Ditto service but keep the API error rate under 10%, and the API will be back to baseline latency within 30 s of rollback with no intervention.",
    "expected_affected": [
      "policies",
      "things",
      "things-search",
      "connectivity"
    ],
    "expected_max_error_rate": 0.1,
    "expected_recovery_s": 30.0
